{"updated":"2026-11-02T00:01:31.814Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: Nine killed as business jet crashes into South Florida neighbourhood. Elsewhere, nine people dead after Learjet crashes in Florida. And why governors’ races are important in the 2026 US midterms. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on Ukraine, at active conflict levels, though US, and Israel are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, felt the weight of it — the S&P 500 down 1.2 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial up 0.8 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite down 5.1 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 46 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 6.0 near 165 km NW of Port-Olry, Vanuatu. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.12,0.16,0.21,0.24,0.28,0.34,0.37,0.41,0.45,0.5,0.52,0.56,0.59,0.61,0.66,0.78,0.87,0.99,1.23,1.35,1.39,1.43,1.45,1.5,1.52,1.54,1.57,1.61,1.66,1.72,1.78,1.82,1.86,1.89,1.94,1.97,2,2.06,2.09,2.14,2.17,2.22,2.26,2.31,2.36,2.4,2.46,2.52,2.58,2.69,2.81,2.96,2.98,3.03,3.05,3.11,3.15,3.22,3.33,3.41,3.47,3.54,3.59,3.65,3.69,3.74,3.79,3.81,3.84,3.89,3.91,3.94,3.96,4,4.04,4.12,4.18,4.24,4.31,4.37,4.48,4.53,4.57,4.6,4.66,4.77,4.9,5.07,5.58,5.68,5.79,5.85,5.91,5.97,6.03,6.11,6.17,6.22,6.28,6.32,6.37,6.46,6.49,6.56,6.61,6.68,6.72,6.76,6.79,6.84,6.88,6.92,6.98,7.04,7.15,7.21,7.28,7.35,7.42,7.49,7.56,7.59,7.67,7.73,7.8,7.85,7.89,7.95,7.98,8.05,8.09,8.16,8.21,8.26,8.29,8.31,8.35,8.42,8.47,8.52,8.57,8.63,8.67,8.73,8.77,8.79,8.82,8.85,8.87,8.92,8.94,8.96,9.01,9.06,9.1,9.15,9.23,9.3,9.62,9.74,9.8,9.86,9.9,9.95,10.01,10.05,10.1,10.22,10.26,10.38,10.46,10.54,10.6,10.65,10.68,10.73,10.77,10.82,10.88,10.93,10.97,11.02,11.06,11.16,11.21,11.31,11.59,11.7,11.76,11.82,11.85,11.88,11.95,11.98,12.06,12.09,12.13,12.2,12.32,12.36,12.43,12.5,12.56,12.63,12.69,12.74,12.82,12.86,12.92,12.96,13,13.07,13.13,